<title>UK: Flights from London Heathrow terminal 3 disrupted.</title>
<headline>Flights from London Heathrow terminal 3 disrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terminal 3 at London's Heathrow Airport was partially evacuated on Monday after a security alert but the rest of the airport was functioning normally, a spokeswoman for the airport said.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been a partial evacuation of an area of Terminal 3. Inevitably there will be some delays to flights to and from terminal three,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>&quot;We are asking passengers originating their flight from terminal three to check with their airline prior to setting out for the airport.&quot;</p>
<p>Terminal 3 covers international flights, excluding British Airways services.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4084</p>
